{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6f1b08f185095be78d18334be5698fe42aad6413810820a4195c7dabadfbf153","ja":"これも女子力？","zh":"这也是女子力？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0b3bb586c394df56d10d763d72fc0d848bb9160791d742876ce14b103b91c6f8","ja":"今日はありがと。\nすっごくいいお店、教えてもらっちゃった♪","zh":"今天谢谢你啦。\n带我认识了一家超棒的店呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"41aa6fc0c008da271c6d9c5166493d8ed882468e5a1d3913d8c1a556fac8cbb5","ja":"いえ。私もずっと来たかったお店ですし……。","zh":"不会。而且这家店也是我一直都很想来的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ed225c5c45ce065e69ee2d8eb0d997d2cb8b6f19b8e8d3a0bc110f64dfed0ff2","ja":"それに、高坂さんと歩くのも、とても\n楽しかったので。また、ご一緒できると嬉しいです。","zh":"而且，能和高坂小姐一起散步，我也觉得\n非常开心。要是下次还能一起，那就太好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"152daa23cfdebf59d6035b9540e87550929402430314a448990767c026c3b8aa","ja":"えへへ。私もまた、つむりんとお出かけしたいな♪\nじゃあさ、今度は夏祭りに行かない？","zh":"嘿嘿。我也想再和小紬一起出门呢♪\n那下次要不要去夏日祭？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b9417c57e9ad9d049fcef2f56c659eac0b2b512783ddc8e522644b9081cef51a","ja":"新しい浴衣、買おうと思ってたんだ！\nあっ、一緒に浴衣も買いに行こっ！","zh":"我本来就打算买新的浴衣呢！\n啊，一起去买浴衣吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"901a910fd25f5af6dc34e5f2557bb59c9d1aa1be0f50a21a28faf12f12055f0f","ja":"はい、ぜひ！","zh":"好，务必！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5960d76f054604ae94eeb4e9e433f0cd7b8cdb248ad3398ff63807492c717f50","ja":"やった～っ☆　じゃあ、食べ終わったことだし、\nさっそく浴衣のお店に行こ！","zh":"太好啦～☆　那既然吃完了，\n这就去浴衣店吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4d4dedce46e9145cadf1595dd7de747a0b86ef73314ec08d9b2783e33b6576ba","ja":"えっ、今から、ですか！？","zh":"欸，现在就去吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"237d679d79059a52248114f19656b9d84597fea57e5af60c510e0424a00979c4","ja":"うん！　スイーツ食べて元気が出たし！\nあ、飲み物足りるかな？　タオルも確認しないと！","zh":"嗯！吃了甜点之后恢复精神了！\n啊，饮料够不够呢？毛巾也得确认一下才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0698eeef70bc0a0d6151ff486888e7cd9f6c153ce5c3bdbd21ce48ffee4f06ee","ja":"……えっ！？　つ、次々に飲み物のボトルとタオルが！\nい、いったいどれだけ用意しているのですか！？","zh":"……诶！？一、一瓶接一瓶的饮料和毛巾！\n究、究竟准备了多少啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d02c94016b380d686240dc5e6d113bfb1d1562bed5f3f3bbc32df6b58cdb0c78","ja":"え～っと……いくつだろ？　とにかくたくさん！\n適当に入れたから、数えてなかったよ。","zh":"嗯～……有多少个呢？反正特别多！\n因为是随便放进去的，所以没数过哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"092978cc76457a83836f8e3b5ca3c137a7d1e33469ac9655c1d62ffa98627b30","ja":"ですが、これだけあると、かなり重たいのでは？\nずっとこれを持ったまま、歩いていたのですか！？","zh":"但是，有这么多的话，应该相当重吧？\n您一直拿着这个走过来的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4ed2f284482f650455232a8ff28cea24d874a9e6d96cd1c772e1194f61894004","ja":"うん。雑誌で、「女子力が高い子は、熱中症対策も\nバッチリ」って書いてたから、入るだけ入れたんだ。","zh":"嗯。因为杂志上写着“女子力高的女孩子，防中暑措施也\n做得十全十美”，所以我就能塞多少塞多少了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6431aa3f42648b39c99294af3c229e502ec1e049b748efe65f036131a2a19f74","ja":"そ、それにしても、限度というものが……。","zh":"话、话虽如此，但也总该有个限度啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"42639e2d51bfecc7c0caa5a8c49baa098097bc59cebd9375f6a4a95ea765a1e6","ja":"さっ、それより早く出発しよ♪","zh":"好啦，比起那个快点出发吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b86ce7efdfba6683526351e32ad6f1294a5a5a366ac214d26e5d866f4ac82e61","ja":"たしか、5つ先の駅にお店があったから、\nそこまでまた、一緒に歩けるよ♪","zh":"我记得往前5站的地方有家店，\n还能再一起走去那里哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1626.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"14f0e6e76f5dd0beaf163e7f24414a807a50ca11eb827a1b049c66ba84f146d1","ja":"ま、まさかまた徒歩ですか！？\nま、待ってください、高坂さん！","zh":"难、难道又要走着去吗！？\n等等、请等一下，高坂同学！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
